#: ../../source/reference/checkbox.rst:13
msgid ""
"The CheckBox class represents an option button that can be toggled "
"between two states: \"on\" or \"off.\" It is commonly used in graphical "
"user interfaces (GUIs) to allow users to select or deselect specific "
"options or features, often in forms or settings."
